Now that you know a lot about different metrics, why would it matter to you as an L1 analyst? First, you should understand that metrics were built to
make the SOC more efficient and, therefore, to make the attacks far less successful. Second, the metrics are often used to evaluate your performance, 
and good results lead to career growth and a raise to more senior positions like L2 analyst. So, how can you improve the metrics?

